<title>UK: UK Treasury sees no pickup in wage settlements.</title>
<headline>UK Treasury sees no pickup in wage settlements.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British Treasury said a rise in average earnings growth, as shown in official data on Wednesday, did not reflect higher wage settlements but was due to factors such as bonuses and overtime.</p>
<p>&quot;Performance-related bonuses and overtime largely account for a small rise in average earnings growth,&quot; a British Treasury official said. &quot;There is no sign of any pickup in wage settlements.&quot;</p>
</text>
